# workshop-app project context

**CWD:** workspace root (`workshop-app/`)

## Key files

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `src/lib/workshop-data.ts` | Lab steps, agenda, hints — edit workshop copy here |
| `src/lib/site-config.ts` | Platform URL default |
| `src/app/page.tsx` | Playground landing |
| `src/components/home-hero.tsx` | Hero section |
| `src/app/globals.css` | Apple design tokens |

## Dev commands

```bash
npm run dev      # :3000 — kit starts this in background when using --kit
npm run build    # required gate before finishing
npm run lint
```

## Env

Copy `.env.sandbox.example` → `.env.local` on the **host** before `sbx run`. Platform default: https://nextjs-26f1-3000.prg1.zerops.app
